 ],
 "notes": "CloudPosse label modules (null-label) create no resources, so module usage itself is not checkable. GT has no root variable literally named 'name' (label name comes from admin_name / other_group_name), so only namespace/environment/tags/attributes are pinned. The admin assume-role policy JSON is unknown at plan (Resource = role ARN), so the MFA/AssumeRole checks rely on the aws_iam_policy_document data source; a candidate using inline jsonencode with the role ARN would have a null policy and fail assume_admin_role_requires_mfa (interpreter limitation: unknown JSON strings). 'attached to both groups' is approximated by attachment counts since attachments cannot be filtered by their ref target."
